{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>When the night awakens, survival begins.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Umbra Survivors</strong>, you fight your way through a world of shadows, curses, and blazing magic. Thousands of creatures pour in \u2014 and you only have one choice: <strong>build your setup, grow stronger, descend deeper.</strong><br>Every run is fast, brutal, and different. Every level-up is a small gambling moment: <strong>roll a rarity, pick a card, feel the power.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6b9d766d67294ab6ad1432b8a05d3f45.avif?t=1774741548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/6b9d766d67294ab6ad1432b8a05d3f45.webp?t=1774741548 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude78 Hordes from the Dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don\u2019t come one by one. <strong>They come as a wave.</strong><br>Shred massive enemy swarms, hold your ground, kite through the chaos \u2014 and stay alive when the screen is full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f68e356e6a2a01a15fa3361fd8d04649.poster.avif?t=1774741548\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f68e356e6a2a01a15fa3361fd8d04649.webm?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f68e356e6a2a01a15fa3361fd8d04649.mp4?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.avif?t=1774741548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.webp?t=1774741548 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4 Rarity-Based Level-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level-up isn\u2019t just \u201c+5% damage.\u201d It\u2019s a decision that shapes your run:<br><strong>weapons, passive upgrades, and cursed artifacts</strong> appear as cards \u2014 with rarities that feel like a straight-up <strong>JACKPOT</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple cards every level-up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarities create real high-roll moments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack effects and craft your own monster build<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/124617fd1e53d9a51a5d84c3bfb3c62b.poster.avif?t=1774741548\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/124617fd1e53d9a51a5d84c3bfb3c62b.webm?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/124617fd1e53d9a51a5d84c3bfb3c62b.mp4?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.avif?t=1774741548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.webp?t=1774741548 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 Epic Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the night wants to test you, it doesn\u2019t send more hordes \u2014 <strong>it sends bosses.</strong><br>Massive attacks, clear patterns, relentless pressure: <strong>one mistake is enough.</strong> A strong build makes the difference.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/932f521364ff8096f6ab4a272b17ba4d.poster.avif?t=1774741548\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/932f521364ff8096f6ab4a272b17ba4d.webm?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/932f521364ff8096f6ab4a272b17ba4d.mp4?t=1774741548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.avif?t=1774741548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/03422ea4580c8e9217889f40d21aecff.webp?t=1774741548 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 Unlock New Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, explore, and earn your next options:<br><strong>new playable characters</strong> unlock through progression \u2014 bringing fresh runs, different strengths, and new build paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action roguelike survival:</strong> fast runs, direct combat flow, constant pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build crafting:</strong> weapons + passives + artifacts change every run in a meaningful way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarities :</strong> every pull can be a power spike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark low-poly fantasy:</strong> clean shapes, grim atmosphere, glowing chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replay value:</strong> \u201cone more run\u201d is guaranteed \u2014 because you always go further</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>How long can you last before the Umbra swallows you?</strong><br><strong>Awaken in the darkness. Fight. Grow. Survive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/4478c5c4c64a9e8d8628655fb743a15c.avif?t=1774741548\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras_big/4478c5c4c64a9e8d8628655fb743a15c.webp?t=1774741548 width=1560 height=884 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108600?t=1774741548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/03cbbb2e32fbff20eb46a3c53bebaa40a321c0fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774741548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/b680fbc88784b3f8aaaa3b340e68b96a93cb3d56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774741548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/b680fbc88784b3f8aaaa3b340e68b96a93cb3d56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774741548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4281810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"